  message: "Landed in PR #815 (dev 3911b43f92) on WI-libib's engine. Registered the first per-(kind,field) population-contract entries: qualified_name on Python function/method/class. Producer half was already done (WI-fagab/ADR-0032); the validator entry now GUARDS it — a regression dropping qualified_name on any of these kinds emits a writer_contract|warning (unbaselined cell -> ceiling 0) that breaks the validation_ratchet self-tree gate. Behavioral evidence (closure-evidence discipline): live survey on real Python (class Widget qn=Widget, method Widget.render qn=Widget.render, function top_level_fn qn=top_level_fn — all populated) -> 0 kind-conditioned violations; unit test covers the fire path. Strengthens the prior any()-level emission-parity probe to per-kind."  # 70a4
